<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Concorde Travel issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Concorde Travel issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concorde Travel Holdings Ltd said on Monday that it was involved in negotiations which, if successfully concluded, could affect the price of Concorde ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The company advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcment was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
